entry.summary:
Every SaaS needs an admin interface -- a place to see all users, manage subscriptions, toggle feature flags, and view key metrics. Most devs build it too late or not at all. Here's a practical admin dashboard built with Next.js 14. app/ admin/ layout.tsx # Admin auth check, nav sidebar page.tsx # Overview metrics users/ page.tsx # User list with search/filter [id]/page.tsx # Individual user detail subscriptions/ page.tsx # Active subscriptions flags/ page.tsx # Feature flag management
